  "canon:title": "Hypomania-like syndrome induced by olanzapine.",
  "canon:abstract": "We report a female patient with a diagnosis of a not otherwise specified psychotic disorder (DSM-IV) who developed hypomania shortly after the introduction of olanzapine treatment.",
